{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3948c9d428b317c85178b4f86586c0610bd5c1b43d4606d9cb63b1ea67530cb7", "ja": "（魔法少女トゥインクルリズムの撮影も佳境！　育の\n演技、撮影を重ねるごとにどんどんよくなってるな！）", "zh": "（魔法少女闪亮节奏的拍摄渐入佳境！\n育的演技也随着拍摄过程越来越精进了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "a212d76cd08e454851fd007a5d581b222b3c5db0023ed2d6b1d0eec15b98617a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、おつかれさま！\nわたし、ちゃんとカッコよくうごけてた？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我的动作有没有很帅气？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0cd7a1ad48d309c6c5569c8984fe2701623bed1b9bef3f932f19840dd23c9b59", "ja": "育、おつかれさま。武器を使ったアクション、\nすごくかっこよかったぞ。レッスンの成果だな！", "zh": "育，你也辛苦了。你使用武器的动作非常帅气喔。\n这都是训练课程的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "13d44172c11c35581ba0f1f39fe5516e9a3988a39ca357be3e4867a807b17252", "ja": "えへへ、みんなで練習したから。でも、よかった～！\nわたし、もっともっとがんばるね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为是跟大家一起练习的啊。\n不过，真是太好了～！我会继续努力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "e6ad825f9a4d15c75ad4e6405e946e5907abb3df4a864ccc3a1b1aca23c7581a", "ja": "動きもだけど、育は長いセリフも全然間違えないよな。\n見ていて感心したよ。", "zh": "除了动作之外，育在念很长的台词时也都没念错。\n我在旁边看得很佩服喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "27768d9c04b7cfb36a469da7dacd80a9d1d2f5433a1ebbe541950f6a7e13219e", "ja": "うん！　わたし、このお話、だいすきなんだ。\nだから、セリフはすぐにおぼえられたの。", "zh": "嗯！我很喜欢这个故事，\n所以台词一下子就记起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5a31e0961bce88b8a8d6997db897897e0011481efb1fed7958934d2b73fb769e", "ja": "なるほど。何か、好きなセリフとかあるのか？", "zh": "原来如此。那么，你有喜欢的台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "9ae92dc0bb8ea54138217fb38b8cedcea4f317321b439a8d946c698461fdf5b6", "ja": "うん、いっぱいあるよ！\nえっとね、とくに好きなのは……。", "zh": "有啊，而且很多喔！\n我想想，我特别喜欢的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "34628e887b98d8c5c6a0935004584d60cd3d6bf910a73e38b7b88a13c34ff3b1", "ja": "「わたし、ずっとだれかのために……\nみんなのために、なにかがしたかったの！」", "zh": "「我一直都想为了别人……\n为了大家，做些什么！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "f096649347a7858c49c492d27b921c40700f1f7d8f1ae62cc331722051ce2b15", "ja": "「ありがとうぴーちゃん、わたしを選んでくれて！\nわたし、せいいっぱいがんばるからね！」", "zh": "「谢谢你，小哔，谢谢你选了我！\n我会尽全力加油的！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "2aaff29216f78af584ca696105c15038a67049f587cd1cffca6a4007d186831f", "ja": "っていうところ！\n{$P$}さんはこのセリフ、覚えてる？", "zh": "我喜欢这里的台词！\n{$P$}先生，你记得这句台词吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0d2e272473e3bc9ad7306bbbd89d7130ac853d3f640ac8d67f2ab70bba0d939e", "ja": "覚えてるよ！　たしか、ぴーちゃんと初めて会った日の\n夜、ベッドで寝る前のセリフだったよな？", "zh": "我记得！是第一次遇到小哔那天晚上，\n你睡前在床上说的台词吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "e61a9a884bbb33d9ff13808eb06094dcd4ba139d1f7e682053facb82f136e609", "ja": "うん！\nあのね、どうしてかっていうと……。", "zh": "对！\n然后啊，要说我为什么喜欢这里的台词……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "25f93cb28fbe2df8ea0804fffed9a981d19f83dbf02441cc8fc885f6daa272b8", "ja": "魔法少女って、こどもなのに\n大人でもできないことができちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "因为魔法少女虽然是小孩子，\n却能办到大人做不到的事情，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1014_030iku", "source_sha256": "945b6d4366fd29b42637c0d13db95e1c8e57c78fd3d17ed7f712303e56149b00", "ja": "わたし……ちゃんと大人の人みたいに、いっぱい\nがんばりたいのにって……、思うことがあるの。", "zh": "我……想要做到跟大人一样程度的努力，可是却……\n我有时候会这么想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f37d60603f62ed78d837b828d3d00754e696256f2f4556884f62fa9aea02519d", "ja": "育……。", "zh": "育……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "8d7eb59a6da47cf52a4322f39a418806e82ddcca245e99879c2317b4df0ba1a6", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。わたし……、\n大人のひとみたいに、ちゃんとがんばれてるかな？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我问你喔。\n我……有没有跟大人一样努力呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_1017", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "当然有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2000_p", "source_sha256": "13f719afa6371335b559b01855a7d47c42362f922b1a15a5e705ff2ec1802c49", "ja": "もちろん！　さっきのアクションもバッチリだったし、\n長台詞もカンペキに覚えてるし……。", "zh": "当然有啊！你刚才的动作戏拍得很棒，\n很长的台词也完美记住了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2001_p", "source_sha256": "4e74a63c7ab06d387d926afa144d06104754ed25b00935370ce8f550ba9bba80", "ja": "もしかしたら、この撮影所の中で、\n一番がんばってるかもしれないぞ？", "zh": "说不定在这个拍摄现场里，\n你是最努力的人喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2002_030iku", "source_sha256": "fa6fcb0694428895faf4130cc81e5801ab939435c0e7fd3a75e4a92d62234ede", "ja": "いちばん……。もう、{$P$}さん、\nそれはいいすぎだよ！", "zh": "最努力的人……真是的，{$P$}先生，\n你说得太夸张了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "44b38f6a365c3385b9078200b1d62d2bc2ddc102823e96e1d5ce153dfbe4eb2e", "ja": "百合子さんも亜利沙さんも、すごくがんばってるし。\nスタッフさんも、いっぱいがんばってるんだからね？", "zh": "百合子姊姊和亚利沙姊姊她们也都很努力啊。\n工作人员也是，大家都非常认真喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2004_p", "source_sha256": "0359f5c1004f62bb2cc0d275dc1a13b946deb7e908fa01a7a60b7dd7c2892646", "ja": "ごめんごめん、そうだよな。それじゃ……\n育は他のみんなと同じくらい、がんばれてるぞ！", "zh": "抱歉抱歉，你说得对。那……\n育，你就跟其他人一样，非常努力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "82622f627e84d25023ad5b94e899cf338034798423e5e6437122af7c3aefc58f", "ja": "えへへっ、よかった！\nありがとう、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2006_030iku", "source_sha256": "d152c1b86fdabaa1446af6479bd9e5a7ee26a435f5b70989b507820ff8c27070", "ja": "わたし、このお仕事がほんとうに大好きだよ！\nさつえいは、もうすぐ終わっちゃうけど……。", "zh": "我真的很喜欢这份工作喔！\n虽然拍摄就快要结束了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_030iku0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_030iku0053_2007_030iku", "source_sha256": "9100788932db55159f467c26d4fe89c7bdf8cf4c9fd3a87da320ccf6e8c51903", "ja": "劇場のステージでのお仕事は、まだいっぱい\nあるよね。わたし、いっぱいいっぱい、がんばるね！", "zh": "但是还有很多剧场舞台上的工作对吧？\n我会非常、非常努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
